#: ../../source/legacy/index.rst:4
msgid "Legacy (In-Process Mode)"
msgstr "遗留（进程内模式）"

#: ../../source/legacy/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"These pages document LMCache's original **in-process mode**, where "
"LMCache ran *inside* the inference engine process (e.g. via "
"``LMCacheConnectorV1`` on vLLM). In-process mode is **deprecated**; new "
"deployments should use :doc:`Multiprocess (MP) mode <../mp/index>`."
msgstr "这些页面记录了 LMCache 的原始**进程内模式**，在这种模式下，LMCache 运行在推理引擎进程*内部*（例如，通过 vLLM 上的 ``LMCacheConnectorV1``）。进程内模式已**弃用**；新的部署应使用 :doc:`多进程 (MP) 模式 <../mp/index>`。"

#: ../../source/legacy/index.rst:14
msgid "Background"
msgstr "背景"

#: ../../source/legacy/index.rst:16
msgid ""
"LMCache began as an in-process library embedded directly in the serving "
"engine. The **multiprocess refactor** moved LMCache into a standalone "
"``lmcache server`` and made an **asynchronous prefetching architecture** "
"the default -- a ``LOOKUP`` followed by background L2→L1 loads -- "
"alongside process isolation, shared caching across engine instances, and "
"multi-tier (L1/L2) storage."
msgstr "LMCache 最初是一个嵌入在服务引擎中的进程内库。**多进程重构**将 LMCache 移动到一个独立的 ``lmcache server``，并将**异步预取架构**设为默认——一个 ``LOOKUP`` 后接后台 L2→L1 加载——同时实现了进程隔离、跨引擎实例的共享缓存和多层（L1/L2）存储。"

#: ../../source/legacy/index.rst:22
msgid ""
"MP is now the recommended mode and is on track to support essentially "
"everything in-process mode did. The pages below are kept for users still "
"on in-process mode and as a historical reference while MP closes any "
"remaining gaps; where a feature already has an MP equivalent, prefer the "
"MP docs."
msgstr "现在推荐使用 MP 模式，并且正在逐步支持进程内模式的所有功能。以下页面保留给仍在使用进程内模式的用户，并作为历史参考，同时 MP 正在弥补任何剩余的差距；如果某个功能已经有 MP 等效实现，请优先参考 MP 文档。"

